        "text": "Prefers a small numeric example before the general formula.",
        "evidence": []
      },
      {
        "id": "N2",
        "kind": "note",
        "concept": "softmax_temperature",
        "text": "Understood temperature as sharpening or flattening a distribution after one hint.",
